# armour/shared/pauldron_layered6_r: the legend LAYERED pauldron on the right shoulder (layered.6; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# stacked lames grown great: a cop over three (legend four) lames hanging down the upper arm, each lame a lit
# row over a shaded row, its top edge standing a pixel proud (the DROP mass).
# 6 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (28 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: N the seams (lames' top edges), P the lit rows, R the last lame, G the glint.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron layered.6
layer armNear
anchor shoulderR
keys pauld
z 5
side R

